pen"},{"text":"5","w":0.012345678806304994,"y":0.26162790702433258,"x":0.60493827160507796,"h":0.0087209299193581336},{"text":"for me. Say'aaaaaah'. Thank you.","h":0.013081394879037256,"w":0.23251028060913093,"y":0.26017441881532632,"x":0.71810700348830148},{"w":0.18930040359497069,"text":"And now let me take your•","x":0.60699589022926359,"y":0.27449249795698605,"h":0.013298199646049946},{"y":0.29069767463246599,"text":"V: What is it, doctor?","x":0.58436214344793258,"w":0.15020575523376467,"h":0.01162790683971926},{"text":"D: Thankfully, it's nothing too serious. I think you've","x":0.58425861480812014,"h":0.01550324112571444,"y":0.30196883554210874,"w":0.3561953353881836},{"y":0.3160113974052885,"w":0.066233525276184202,"h":0.016218628172104399,"text":"got the7","x":0.60587398711894103},{"y":0.3313953488185124,"text":"V: Hmm. So what should I do now?","x":0.58436214921561036,"h":0.01162790683971926,"w":0.24691356658935537},{"h":0.014746557372077196,"y":0.34447674398478545,"w":0.1913580131530761,"x":0.58641976104177462,"text":"D: I'm going to give you a ®"},{"w":0.33539093017578114,"x":0.60699589715490765,"text":"medicine. Take it to the chemist's, then go home","h":0.011685636121408161,"y":0.35901162778169082},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"y":0.37334510158436685,"x":0.60699589208681293,"text":"to bed. You need to rest for a few days then you","w":0.33127571105957032},{"y":0.38790820810215698,"w":0.3436214065551757,"x":0.60699587678928457,"h":0.011915269196822509,"text":"should be fine. One more thing, as soon as you're"},{"x":0.60493826709416409,"text":"feeling better, I suggest you buy some trousers","w":0.32716049194335939,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.40247131494072419},{"y":0.41408455887261897,"text":"that cover your ankles and wear a hat and a scarf.","w":0.34184104919433589,"h":0.015616395888029766,"x":0.60681681908627727},{"h":0.011915269196822509,"y":0.43159752883025626,"x":0.6069958880981382,"text":"It is winter, you know!","w":0.15020575523376467},{"x":0.