 ago","w":0.12962962150573731,"y":0.62488967330807688},{"y":0.6394527801498302,"w":0.15843621253967288,"x":0.58641975579292061,"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"D: Hmm, OK. Please 31"},{"text":"e down here. And","w":0.12551440238952638,"y":0.63808139550040632,"x":0.82304526725026916,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"x":0.60905350030576588,"y":0.65261627921382437,"w":0.14197530746459963,"text":"now l want you to 4b","h":0.013081394879037367},{"text":"e in and out.","w":0.0946502017974854,"x":0.82716049423157301,"y":0.65261627951387891,"h":0.010225732875733029},{"x":0.60699588220782486,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"Nice and deep. Thank you. You can sit up now.","y":0.66715116324362089,"w":0.32304527282714846},{"x":0.58436214032584932,"h":0.010174417958676241,"text":"L: And?","y":0.68313953537628203,"w":0.063786005973815896},{"x":0.58620339843612768,"text":"D: I think you've got an 5i","y":0.69418335968542333,"w":0.20819383621215826,"h":0.016486481871104131},{"y":0.69461606340642756,"x":0.84362140027920762,"h":0.010325796711476376,"text":"nbut I'm","w":0.067901234626770002},{"w":0.11457983016967765,"h":0.015747460872855612,"text":"going to do a b","x":0.60834794015318328,"y":0.70869603648399093},{"x":0.79218107216335343,"y":0.70784883727781489,"w":0.13580246925354,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"d test to be sure."},{"h":0.01459774461764729,"x":0.60905351053322787,"y":0.72238372081375835,"w":0.31275718688964849,"text":"Please roll up the sleeve on your jumper. This"},{"x":0.60905350757828469,"h":0.011694616063548047,"y":0.73830538386793942,"text":"shouldn't hurt too much.","w":0.17078187942504885},{"h":0.0092344654416575134,"x":0.58635543477422691,"w":0.068029870986938468,"text":"L: Ouch!","y":0.75410369749773787},{"x":0.58641976340515389,"h":0.014727313857318403,"y":0.76434245342243101,"text":"D: There you go. That wasn't too painful, was it?","w":0.33333332061767573},{"y":0.77890556039753533,"w":0.33744853973388667,"text":"The results will be ready tomorrow and I'm going","h":0.01324560194023916,"x":0.60905351134018959},{"w":0.098898973464965789,"h":0.013593299138472403,"text":"to make an 'a","x":0.60692911525424564,"y":0.79334869904390826},{"x":0.77935953506522671,"text":"tfor you to see","w":0.11607623100280762,"h":0.016228123670748107,"y":0.79282246413653379},{"x":0.60905349811418064,"y":0.80959302313052794,"w":0.028806583881378134,"text":"a ®s","h":0.01167793896802205},{"text":"t.","y":0.81104651183295651,"w":0.014403291940689011,"x":0.71604938259618511,"h":0.0087209299193582446},{"y":0.82259488079561505,"text":"L: Oh, no. Is it serious? I'm probably just","h":0.013239187996469504,"x":0.58641975781317801,"w":0.28395061492919915},{"text":"_c to something, right? Maybe nuts","y":0.83575581407926225,"x":0.69958848007980801,"w":0.24691356658935548,"h":0.014641361960455734},{"y":0.85148538521452266,"text":"or gluten or something?","x":0.60876456201175666,"w":0.1714898109436036,"h":0.01522329352329177},{"text":"D: Well, there's certainly no need to worry just yet.","y":0.86482558155757427,"w":0.34773662567138675,"h":0.013081394879037367,"x":0.58641975880353825},{"y":0.87936046528169076,"text":"Come back tomorrow and we'll see what we can do.","w":0.33950614929199219,"h":0.011636886781859146,"x":0.60905350405770775},{"w":0.38922821044921874,"y":0.89930679792182322,"text":"4 Read the dialogues in Exercises 2 and 3 again and","h":0.016320205850087754,"x":0.56157947160820743},{"w":0.36625514984130858,"h":0.013081394879037256,"y":0.91424418617966741,"text":"decide which photo A-C shows Victoria and which","x":0.58641975384477774},{"x":0.58436213908921675,"text":"Laura. There is one extra picture.","y":0.93023255825649687,"h":0.01162790683971926,"w":0.24279834747314455},{"y":0.94912790727220619,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"112","w":0.034979424476623541,"x":0.088477365659493448}]